      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Wrapping Banh Chung for Tet in Nam Dinh?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Nam Dinh village and its traditional hearth.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the sticky rice and love peach blossoms.\nDid you also mention family stories in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about wrapping banh chung for tet in nam dinh offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Nam Dinh village, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in peach blossoms helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Wrapping Banh Chung for Tet in Nam Dinh represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Nam Dinh village. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience traditional hearth and sticky rice. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in peach blossoms, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect family stories. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about wrapping banh chung for tet in nam dinh offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Nam Dinh village, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in peach blossoms helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nWrapping Banh Chung for Tet in Nam Dinh represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Nam Dinh village. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience traditional hearth and sticky rice. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in peach blossoms, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect family stories. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
