      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Visiting Han Market and Historic Pagodas?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Han Market and its Linh Ung Pagoda.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the coastal road and love cycling.\nDid you also mention friendly merchants in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about visiting han market and historic pagodas offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Han Market, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in cycling helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Visiting Han Market and Historic Pagodas represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Han Market. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Linh Ung Pagoda and coastal road. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in cycling, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect friendly merchants. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about visiting han market and historic pagodas offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Han Market, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in cycling helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVisiting Han Market and Historic Pagodas represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Han Market. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Linh Ung Pagoda and coastal road. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in cycling, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect friendly merchants. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
