          "correct": "Visiting Han Market and Historic Pagodas in Han Market is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by Linh Ung Pagoda and refreshing coastal road. During my visit, I enjoyed cycling and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about friendly merchants deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
