          "correct": "Decorating the Living Room for New Year in living room is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by apricot blossom and refreshing lucky money. During my visit, I enjoyed cleaning furniture and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about greeting elders deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
