      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Living Near West Lake in Ha Noi?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about West Lake and its waterfront promenade.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the clean air and love jogging.\nDid you also mention local flower stall in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about living near west lake in ha noi offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In West Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in jogging helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Living Near West Lake in Ha Noi represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with West Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience waterfront promenade and clean air. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in jogging, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect local flower stall. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about living near west lake in ha noi offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In West Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in jogging helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLiving Near West Lake in Ha Noi represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with West Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience waterfront promenade and clean air. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in jogging, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect local flower stall. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
