      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Conquering the Peak of Fansipan?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Fansipan and its Roof of Indochina.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the cable car and love misty clouds.\nDid you also mention hiking trails in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about conquering the peak of fansipan offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Fansipan, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in misty clouds helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Conquering the Peak of Fansipan represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Fansipan. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Roof of Indochina and cable car. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in misty clouds, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect hiking trails. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about conquering the peak of fansipan offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Fansipan, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in misty clouds helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nConquering the Peak of Fansipan represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Fansipan. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Roof of Indochina and cable car. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in misty clouds, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect hiking trails. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
