      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about A Bicycle Tour around Hoi An Ancient Town?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Hoi An and its Japanese Bridge.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the lantern street and love tailor shops.\nDid you also mention ancient houses in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about a bicycle tour around hoi an ancient town offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Hoi An, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in tailor shops helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "A Bicycle Tour around Hoi An Ancient Town represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Hoi An. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Japanese Bridge and lantern street. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in tailor shops, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect ancient houses. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about a bicycle tour around hoi an ancient town offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Hoi An, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in tailor shops helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nA Bicycle Tour around Hoi An Ancient Town represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Hoi An. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Japanese Bridge and lantern street. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in tailor shops, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect ancient houses. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
