          "correct": "A Bicycle Tour around Hoi An Ancient Town in Hoi An is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by Japanese Bridge and refreshing lantern street. During my visit, I enjoyed tailor shops and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about ancient houses deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
