      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about A Friendly Neighbourhood in Can Tho?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Can Tho and its floating market.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the fruit orchards and love wooden boat.\nDid you also mention sweet mangoes in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about a friendly neighbourhood in can tho offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Can Tho, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in wooden boat helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "A Friendly Neighbourhood in Can Tho represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Can Tho. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience floating market and fruit orchards. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in wooden boat, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect sweet mangoes. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about a friendly neighbourhood in can tho offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Can Tho, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in wooden boat helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nA Friendly Neighbourhood in Can Tho represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Can Tho. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience floating market and fruit orchards. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in wooden boat, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect sweet mangoes. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
