      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Discovering Thien Cung Cave Formations?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Thien Cung Cave and its celestial chamber.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the colourful lighting and love geological wonder.\nDid you also mention stone pillars in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about discovering thien cung cave formations offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Thien Cung Cave, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in geological wonder helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Discovering Thien Cung Cave Formations represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Thien Cung Cave. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience celestial chamber and colourful lighting. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in geological wonder, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect stone pillars. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about discovering thien cung cave formations offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Thien Cung Cave, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in geological wonder helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDiscovering Thien Cung Cave Formations represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Thien Cung Cave. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience celestial chamber and colourful lighting. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in geological wonder, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect stone pillars. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
