      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about An Eco-Friendly Stilt House in Mai Chau?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Mai Chau and its green valley.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the stilt house and love rice terraces.\nDid you also mention weaving loom in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about an eco-friendly stilt house in mai chau offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Mai Chau, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in rice terraces helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "An Eco-Friendly Stilt House in Mai Chau represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Mai Chau. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience green valley and stilt house. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in rice terraces, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect weaving loom. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about an eco-friendly stilt house in mai chau offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Mai Chau, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in rice terraces helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAn Eco-Friendly Stilt House in Mai Chau represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Mai Chau. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience green valley and stilt house. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in rice terraces, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect weaving loom. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
