      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Wooden Boat Ride across Ba Be Lake?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Ba Be Lake and its mountain lake.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the freshwater fishes and love An Ma Temple.\nDid you also mention tranquil waters in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about wooden boat ride across ba be lake offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Ba Be Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in An Ma Temple helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Wooden Boat Ride across Ba Be Lake represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Ba Be Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience mountain lake and freshwater fishes. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in An Ma Temple, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect tranquil waters. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about wooden boat ride across ba be lake offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Ba Be Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in An Ma Temple helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nWooden Boat Ride across Ba Be Lake represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Ba Be Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience mountain lake and freshwater fishes. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in An Ma Temple, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect tranquil waters. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
