          "correct": "Wooden Boat Ride across Ba Be Lake in Ba Be Lake is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by mountain lake and refreshing freshwater fishes. During my visit, I enjoyed An Ma Temple and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about tranquil waters deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
