      "audioScript": "Have you finished preparing your presentation about Village Spring Festivals and Folk Games?\nYes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about communal house and its tug of war.\nWhat is the most memorable feature there?\nVisitors are truly amazed by the bamboo swinging and love traditional drumming.\nDid you also mention community joy in your talk?\nAbsolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nExcellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about village spring festivals and folk games offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In communal house, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in traditional drumming helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Village Spring Festivals and Folk Games represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with communal house. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience tug of war and bamboo swinging. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in traditional drumming, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect community joy. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about village spring festivals and folk games offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In communal house, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in traditional drumming helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVillage Spring Festivals and Folk Games represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with communal house. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience tug of war and bamboo swinging. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in traditional drumming, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect community joy. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
