          "correct": "Traditional Water Puppet Theatre in Ha Noi at Thang Long Theatre is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases wooden puppets on water and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in watching puppet plays, visitors discover how traditional folk orchestra has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding bamboo screen helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
