      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about The Culinary Art of Traditional Ha Noi Pho at Ha Noi Old Quarter.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates fragrant simmering broth and enjoys enjoying hot pho bowls.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights tender beef slices and showcases the authentic value of fresh herbs and lime.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the culinary art of traditional ha noi pho, students discover how Ha Noi Old Quarter preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering enjoying hot pho bowls requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire fragrant simmering broth, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Culinary Art of Traditional Ha Noi Pho represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Ha Noi Old Quarter. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined fragrant simmering broth and tender beef slices, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in enjoying hot pho bowls, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard fresh herbs and lime to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the culinary art of traditional ha noi pho, students discover how Ha Noi Old Quarter preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering enjoying hot pho bowls requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire fragrant simmering broth, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Culinary Art of Traditional Ha Noi Pho represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Ha Noi Old Quarter. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined fragrant simmering broth and tender beef slices, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in enjoying hot pho bowls, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard fresh herbs and lime to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "The Culinary Art of Traditional Ha Noi Pho at Ha Noi Old Quarter is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases fragrant simmering broth and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in enjoying hot pho bowls, visitors discover how tender beef slices has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding fresh herbs and lime helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
