          "correct": "The Culinary Art of Traditional Ha Noi Pho at Ha Noi Old Quarter is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases fragrant simmering broth and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in enjoying hot pho bowls, visitors discover how tender beef slices has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding fresh herbs and lime helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
