          "correct": "Dong Ho Folk Painting Craft in Bac Ninh at Dong Ho village is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases natural woodblock prints and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in painting folk designs, visitors discover how scallop shell paper has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding traditional artisan helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
