          "correct": "The Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue at Hue imperial city is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases lemongrass spicy broth and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in tasting imperial dishes, visitors discover how round rice noodles has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding banana flower salad helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
