      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Chu Van An High School - An Ancient Heritage at Chu Van An school.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates colonial brick architecture and enjoys studying in library.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights historic lakeview courtyard and showcases the authentic value of statue of teacher Chu Van An.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying chu van an high school - an ancient heritage, students discover how Chu Van An school preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering studying in library requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire colonial brick architecture, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Chu Van An High School - An Ancient Heritage represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Chu Van An school. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined colonial brick architecture and historic lakeview courtyard, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in studying in library, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard statue of teacher Chu Van An to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying chu van an high school - an ancient heritage, students discover how Chu Van An school preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering studying in library requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire colonial brick architecture, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nChu Van An High School - An Ancient Heritage represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Chu Van An school. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined colonial brick architecture and historic lakeview courtyard, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in studying in library, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard statue of teacher Chu Van An to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
