          "correct": "The Imperial Examination Halls of Ancient Dai Viet at National Museum is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases ancient stone tablets and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in reading ancient history, visitors discover how scholar writing desks has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding bronze bell helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
