      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Classical Orchestral Music and Traditional Instruments at Opera House.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates violins and traditional Dan Bau and enjoys attending classical concert.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights harmonious symphony and showcases the authentic value of conductor baton.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying classical orchestral music and traditional instruments, students discover how Opera House preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering attending classical concert requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire violins and traditional Dan Bau, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Classical Orchestral Music and Traditional Instruments represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Opera House. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined violins and traditional Dan Bau and harmonious symphony, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in attending classical concert, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard conductor baton to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying classical orchestral music and traditional instruments, students discover how Opera House preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering attending classical concert requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire violins and traditional Dan Bau, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nClassical Orchestral Music and Traditional Instruments represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Opera House. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined violins and traditional Dan Bau and harmonious symphony, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in attending classical concert, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard conductor baton to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "Classical Orchestral Music and Traditional Instruments at Opera House is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases violins and traditional Dan Bau and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in attending classical concert, visitors discover how harmonious symphony has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding conductor baton helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
