          "correct": "Classical Orchestral Music and Traditional Instruments at Opera House is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases violins and traditional Dan Bau and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in attending classical concert, visitors discover how harmonious symphony has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding conductor baton helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
