      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Quoc Tu Giam - The First University of Viet Nam at ancient academy.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates sacred tortoise statues and enjoys photographing lotus ponds.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights ancient Well of Heavenly Clarity and showcases the authentic value of historic stone tablet.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying quoc tu giam - the first university of viet nam, students discover how ancient academy preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering photographing lotus ponds requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire sacred tortoise statues, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Quoc Tu Giam - The First University of Viet Nam represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in ancient academy. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined sacred tortoise statues and ancient Well of Heavenly Clarity, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in photographing lotus ponds, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard historic stone tablet to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying quoc tu giam - the first university of viet nam, students discover how ancient academy preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering photographing lotus ponds requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire sacred tortoise statues, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nQuoc Tu Giam - The First University of Viet Nam represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in ancient academy. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined sacred tortoise statues and ancient Well of Heavenly Clarity, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in photographing lotus ponds, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard historic stone tablet to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "Quoc Tu Giam - The First University of Viet Nam at ancient academy is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases sacred tortoise statues and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in photographing lotus ponds, visitors discover how ancient Well of Heavenly Clarity has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding historic stone tablet helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
