      "sampleWritingText": "Modern Photography and Teenage Art Clubs at school art studio is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases creative lens angles and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in capturing city life, visitors discover how portrait exhibition has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding camera tripod helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
