      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Visiting Le Hong Phong High School Heritage at Ho Chi Minh City.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates historic French archways and enjoys visiting school museum.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights science laboratories and showcases the authentic value of memorial library.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying visiting le hong phong high school heritage, students discover how Ho Chi Minh City preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering visiting school museum requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire historic French archways, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Visiting Le Hong Phong High School Heritage represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Ho Chi Minh City. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined historic French archways and science laboratories, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in visiting school museum, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard memorial library to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying visiting le hong phong high school heritage, students discover how Ho Chi Minh City preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering visiting school museum requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire historic French archways, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVisiting Le Hong Phong High School Heritage represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Ho Chi Minh City. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined historic French archways and science laboratories, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in visiting school museum, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard memorial library to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
