      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Banh Mi - The World-Famous Vietnamese Sandwich at local street bistro.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates crusty toasted baguette and enjoys ordering takeaway lunch.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights rich pate and pickled daikon and showcases the authentic value of coriander garnish.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying banh mi - the world-famous vietnamese sandwich, students discover how local street bistro preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering ordering takeaway lunch requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire crusty toasted baguette, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Banh Mi - The World-Famous Vietnamese Sandwich represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in local street bistro. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined crusty toasted baguette and rich pate and pickled daikon, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in ordering takeaway lunch, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard coriander garnish to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying banh mi - the world-famous vietnamese sandwich, students discover how local street bistro preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering ordering takeaway lunch requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire crusty toasted baguette, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBanh Mi - The World-Famous Vietnamese Sandwich represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in local street bistro. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined crusty toasted baguette and rich pate and pickled daikon, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in ordering takeaway lunch, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard coriander garnish to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "Banh Mi - The World-Famous Vietnamese Sandwich at local street bistro is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases crusty toasted baguette and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in ordering takeaway lunch, visitors discover how rich pate and pickled daikon has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding coriander garnish helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
