      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nI am presenting about Banh Xeo - Sizzling Savoury Vietnamese Pancakes at Mekong Delta.\nWhat is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nEveryone appreciates crispy yellow pancake crust and enjoys wrapping in mustard leaves.\nHow does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nIt highlights bean sprouts and pork and showcases the authentic value of garlic chili sauce.\nThat is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying banh xeo - sizzling savoury vietnamese pancakes, students discover how Mekong Delta preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering wrapping in mustard leaves requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire crispy yellow pancake crust, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Banh Xeo - Sizzling Savoury Vietnamese Pancakes represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Mekong Delta. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined crispy yellow pancake crust and bean sprouts and pork, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in wrapping in mustard leaves, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard garlic chili sauce to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying banh xeo - sizzling savoury vietnamese pancakes, students discover how Mekong Delta preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering wrapping in mustard leaves requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire crispy yellow pancake crust, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBanh Xeo - Sizzling Savoury Vietnamese Pancakes represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Mekong Delta. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined crispy yellow pancake crust and bean sprouts and pork, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in wrapping in mustard leaves, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard garlic chili sauce to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "Banh Xeo - Sizzling Savoury Vietnamese Pancakes at Mekong Delta is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases crispy yellow pancake crust and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in wrapping in mustard leaves, visitors discover how bean sprouts and pork has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding garlic chili sauce helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
