          "correct": "Banh Xeo - Sizzling Savoury Vietnamese Pancakes at Mekong Delta is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases crispy yellow pancake crust and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in wrapping in mustard leaves, visitors discover how bean sprouts and pork has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding garlic chili sauce helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
