      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about The Flower H'mong Vibrant Costumes in Bac Ha at Bac Ha fair market.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by intricate pleated skirts and enjoy embroidering geometric motifs.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces colourful indigo dyed linen and honors the spiritual value of silver neck torcs.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In Bac Ha fair market, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving intricate pleated skirts and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in embroidering geometric motifs, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating colourful indigo dyed linen helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing silver neck torcs strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Flower H'mong Vibrant Costumes in Bac Ha exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in Bac Ha fair market. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies intricate pleated skirts and reflects colourful indigo dyed linen, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in embroidering geometric motifs maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize silver neck torcs as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In Bac Ha fair market, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving intricate pleated skirts and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in embroidering geometric motifs, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating colourful indigo dyed linen helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing silver neck torcs strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Flower H'mong Vibrant Costumes in Bac Ha exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in Bac Ha fair market. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies intricate pleated skirts and reflects colourful indigo dyed linen, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in embroidering geometric motifs maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize silver neck torcs as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
