      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Table Manners and Meal Etiquette Across Cultures at family dining room.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by respectful chopsticks etiquette and enjoy sharing communal soup bowls.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces inviting elders before eating and honors the spiritual value of polite dining phrases.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In family dining room, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving respectful chopsticks etiquette and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in sharing communal soup bowls, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating inviting elders before eating helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing polite dining phrases strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Table Manners and Meal Etiquette Across Cultures exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in family dining room. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies respectful chopsticks etiquette and reflects inviting elders before eating, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in sharing communal soup bowls maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize polite dining phrases as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In family dining room, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving respectful chopsticks etiquette and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in sharing communal soup bowls, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating inviting elders before eating helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing polite dining phrases strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTable Manners and Meal Etiquette Across Cultures exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in family dining room. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies respectful chopsticks etiquette and reflects inviting elders before eating, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in sharing communal soup bowls maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize polite dining phrases as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Table Manners and Meal Etiquette Across Cultures is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in family dining room, it embodies respectful chopsticks etiquette and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing sharing communal soup bowls instills profound moral values and preserves inviting elders before eating. Moreover, honoring polite dining phrases reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
