      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Digital Nomadism: Remote Working around the World at co-working beach cafe.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by high-speed wireless networks and enjoy coding software on laptops.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces flexible freelance schedules and honors the spiritual value of portable solar powerbank.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In co-working beach cafe, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving high-speed wireless networks and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in coding software on laptops, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating flexible freelance schedules helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing portable solar powerbank strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Digital Nomadism: Remote Working around the World exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in co-working beach cafe. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies high-speed wireless networks and reflects flexible freelance schedules, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in coding software on laptops maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize portable solar powerbank as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In co-working beach cafe, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving high-speed wireless networks and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in coding software on laptops, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating flexible freelance schedules helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing portable solar powerbank strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDigital Nomadism: Remote Working around the World exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in co-working beach cafe. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies high-speed wireless networks and reflects flexible freelance schedules, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in coding software on laptops maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize portable solar powerbank as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
