      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Gong Cultural Space in the Central Highlands at Gia Lai communal house.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by resonant bronze gongs and enjoy dancing in circular troupes.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces sacred bonfire rituals and honors the spiritual value of village elder chieftain.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In Gia Lai communal house, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving resonant bronze gongs and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in dancing in circular troupes, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating sacred bonfire rituals helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing village elder chieftain strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Gong Cultural Space in the Central Highlands exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in Gia Lai communal house. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies resonant bronze gongs and reflects sacred bonfire rituals, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in dancing in circular troupes maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize village elder chieftain as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In Gia Lai communal house, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving resonant bronze gongs and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in dancing in circular troupes, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating sacred bonfire rituals helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing village elder chieftain strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGong Cultural Space in the Central Highlands exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in Gia Lai communal house. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies resonant bronze gongs and reflects sacred bonfire rituals, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in dancing in circular troupes maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize village elder chieftain as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
