      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about The Tea Ceremony and Social Norms in East Asia at quiet bamboo teahouse.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by delicate porcelain teacups and enjoy savoring roasted green tea.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces mindful hot water pouring and honors the spiritual value of wooden tea tray.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In quiet bamboo teahouse, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving delicate porcelain teacups and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in savoring roasted green tea, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating mindful hot water pouring helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing wooden tea tray strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Tea Ceremony and Social Norms in East Asia exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in quiet bamboo teahouse. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies delicate porcelain teacups and reflects mindful hot water pouring, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in savoring roasted green tea maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize wooden tea tray as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In quiet bamboo teahouse, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving delicate porcelain teacups and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in savoring roasted green tea, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating mindful hot water pouring helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing wooden tea tray strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Tea Ceremony and Social Norms in East Asia exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in quiet bamboo teahouse. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies delicate porcelain teacups and reflects mindful hot water pouring, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in savoring roasted green tea maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize wooden tea tray as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, The Tea Ceremony and Social Norms in East Asia is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in quiet bamboo teahouse, it embodies delicate porcelain teacups and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing savoring roasted green tea instills profound moral values and preserves mindful hot water pouring. Moreover, honoring wooden tea tray reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
