      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Sustainable Eco-Villages and Organic Farming Lifestyles at permaculture farm.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by sun-drenched terraced gardens and enjoy harvesting heirloom vegetables.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces zero chemical fertilizers and honors the spiritual value of rainwater collection tank.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In permaculture farm, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving sun-drenched terraced gardens and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in harvesting heirloom vegetables, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating zero chemical fertilizers helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing rainwater collection tank strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Sustainable Eco-Villages and Organic Farming Lifestyles exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in permaculture farm. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies sun-drenched terraced gardens and reflects zero chemical fertilizers, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in harvesting heirloom vegetables maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize rainwater collection tank as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In permaculture farm, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving sun-drenched terraced gardens and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in harvesting heirloom vegetables, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating zero chemical fertilizers helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing rainwater collection tank strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSustainable Eco-Villages and Organic Farming Lifestyles exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in permaculture farm. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies sun-drenched terraced gardens and reflects zero chemical fertilizers, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in harvesting heirloom vegetables maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize rainwater collection tank as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Sustainable Eco-Villages and Organic Farming Lifestyles is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in permaculture farm, it embodies sun-drenched terraced gardens and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing harvesting heirloom vegetables instills profound moral values and preserves zero chemical fertilizers. Moreover, honoring rainwater collection tank reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
