      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Traditional Village Festivals and Communal Values at ancient village banyan.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by ceremonial palanquin parades and enjoy participating in tug of war.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces folk wrestling matches and honors the spiritual value of communal bronze drum.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In ancient village banyan, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving ceremonial palanquin parades and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in participating in tug of war, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating folk wrestling matches helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing communal bronze drum strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Traditional Village Festivals and Communal Values exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in ancient village banyan. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies ceremonial palanquin parades and reflects folk wrestling matches, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in participating in tug of war maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize communal bronze drum as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In ancient village banyan, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving ceremonial palanquin parades and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in participating in tug of war, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating folk wrestling matches helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing communal bronze drum strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTraditional Village Festivals and Communal Values exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in ancient village banyan. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies ceremonial palanquin parades and reflects folk wrestling matches, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in participating in tug of war maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize communal bronze drum as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Traditional Village Festivals and Communal Values is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in ancient village banyan, it embodies ceremonial palanquin parades and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing participating in tug of war instills profound moral values and preserves folk wrestling matches. Moreover, honoring communal bronze drum reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
