      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about The Pa Then Fire Dancing Festival in Tuyen Quang at mountainous hamlet.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by crackling red-hot embers and enjoy leaping over red embers.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces hypnotic drum beats and honors the spiritual value of spiritual village shaman.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In mountainous hamlet, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving crackling red-hot embers and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in leaping over red embers, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating hypnotic drum beats helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing spiritual village shaman strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Pa Then Fire Dancing Festival in Tuyen Quang exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in mountainous hamlet. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies crackling red-hot embers and reflects hypnotic drum beats, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in leaping over red embers maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize spiritual village shaman as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In mountainous hamlet, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving crackling red-hot embers and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in leaping over red embers, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating hypnotic drum beats helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing spiritual village shaman strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Pa Then Fire Dancing Festival in Tuyen Quang exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in mountainous hamlet. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies crackling red-hot embers and reflects hypnotic drum beats, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in leaping over red embers maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize spiritual village shaman as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, The Pa Then Fire Dancing Festival in Tuyen Quang is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in mountainous hamlet, it embodies crackling red-hot embers and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing leaping over red embers instills profound moral values and preserves hypnotic drum beats. Moreover, honoring spiritual village shaman reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
