      "audioScript": "What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nI am presenting about Mid-Autumn Mooncake Baking Family Heritage at family bakery kitchen.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nAnthropologists and participants are intrigued by traditional wooden mooncake molds and enjoy pressing lotus seed cakes.\nHow does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nIt reinforces golden baked salted yolks and honors the spiritual value of fragrant jasmine tea.\nWonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In family bakery kitchen, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving traditional wooden mooncake molds and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in pressing lotus seed cakes, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating golden baked salted yolks helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing fragrant jasmine tea strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Mid-Autumn Mooncake Baking Family Heritage exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in family bakery kitchen. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies traditional wooden mooncake molds and reflects golden baked salted yolks, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in pressing lotus seed cakes maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize fragrant jasmine tea as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In family bakery kitchen, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving traditional wooden mooncake molds and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in pressing lotus seed cakes, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating golden baked salted yolks helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing fragrant jasmine tea strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMid-Autumn Mooncake Baking Family Heritage exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in family bakery kitchen. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies traditional wooden mooncake molds and reflects golden baked salted yolks, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in pressing lotus seed cakes maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize fragrant jasmine tea as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
