      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Nostalgic Tramcar Routes in 20th Century Ha Noi at Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by clanging electric tram bells and intrigued by riding vintage street trams.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights wooden bench passenger cars and demonstrates the enduring value of central tramway depot.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square, historians and architects have meticulously studied clanging electric tram bells to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in riding vintage street trams, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving central tramway depot guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Nostalgic Tramcar Routes in 20th Century Ha Noi serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square. Throughout decades of change, clanging electric tram bells and wooden bench passenger cars have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in riding vintage street trams gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect central tramway depot to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square, historians and architects have meticulously studied clanging electric tram bells to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in riding vintage street trams, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving central tramway depot guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNostalgic Tramcar Routes in 20th Century Ha Noi serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square. Throughout decades of change, clanging electric tram bells and wooden bench passenger cars have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in riding vintage street trams gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect central tramway depot to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Nostalgic Tramcar Routes in 20th Century Ha Noi offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in Dong Kinh Nghia Thuc square, it commemorates clanging electric tram bells and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on riding vintage street trams helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring wooden bench passenger cars. Furthermore, safeguarding central tramway depot preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
