      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Viet Nam's Economic Transformation (Doi Moi) Since 1986 at modern metropolis skyline.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by booming export manufacturing and intrigued by reflecting on economic progress.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights thriving international trade and demonstrates the enduring value of historical archive museum.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In modern metropolis skyline, historians and architects have meticulously studied booming export manufacturing to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in reflecting on economic progress, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving historical archive museum guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Viet Nam's Economic Transformation (Doi Moi) Since 1986 serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with modern metropolis skyline. Throughout decades of change, booming export manufacturing and thriving international trade have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in reflecting on economic progress gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect historical archive museum to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In modern metropolis skyline, historians and architects have meticulously studied booming export manufacturing to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in reflecting on economic progress, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving historical archive museum guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nViet Nam's Economic Transformation (Doi Moi) Since 1986 serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with modern metropolis skyline. Throughout decades of change, booming export manufacturing and thriving international trade have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in reflecting on economic progress gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect historical archive museum to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Viet Nam's Economic Transformation (Doi Moi) Since 1986 offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in modern metropolis skyline, it commemorates booming export manufacturing and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on reflecting on economic progress helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring thriving international trade. Furthermore, safeguarding historical archive museum preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
