      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Childhood Folk Games and Traditional Toys (O An Quan) at village communal courtyard.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by smooth river pebbles and chalk grids and intrigued by playing traditional board games.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights counting capturing pebbles and demonstrates the enduring value of bamboo toy spinner.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In village communal courtyard, historians and architects have meticulously studied smooth river pebbles and chalk grids to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in playing traditional board games, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving bamboo toy spinner guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Childhood Folk Games and Traditional Toys (O An Quan) serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with village communal courtyard. Throughout decades of change, smooth river pebbles and chalk grids and counting capturing pebbles have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in playing traditional board games gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect bamboo toy spinner to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In village communal courtyard, historians and architects have meticulously studied smooth river pebbles and chalk grids to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in playing traditional board games, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving bamboo toy spinner guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nChildhood Folk Games and Traditional Toys (O An Quan) serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with village communal courtyard. Throughout decades of change, smooth river pebbles and chalk grids and counting capturing pebbles have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in playing traditional board games gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect bamboo toy spinner to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Childhood Folk Games and Traditional Toys (O An Quan) offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in village communal courtyard, it commemorates smooth river pebbles and chalk grids and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on playing traditional board games helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring counting capturing pebbles. Furthermore, safeguarding bamboo toy spinner preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
