      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about From Mud Alleyways to Modern Elevated Metro Lines at rapid urban transit system.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by aerial concrete guideways and intrigued by commuting on rapid metro.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights automated ticketing gates and demonstrates the enduring value of smart travel transit card.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In rapid urban transit system, historians and architects have meticulously studied aerial concrete guideways to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in commuting on rapid metro, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving smart travel transit card guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "From Mud Alleyways to Modern Elevated Metro Lines serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with rapid urban transit system. Throughout decades of change, aerial concrete guideways and automated ticketing gates have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in commuting on rapid metro gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect smart travel transit card to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In rapid urban transit system, historians and architects have meticulously studied aerial concrete guideways to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in commuting on rapid metro, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving smart travel transit card guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFrom Mud Alleyways to Modern Elevated Metro Lines serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with rapid urban transit system. Throughout decades of change, aerial concrete guideways and automated ticketing gates have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in commuting on rapid metro gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect smart travel transit card to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, From Mud Alleyways to Modern Elevated Metro Lines offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in rapid urban transit system, it commemorates aerial concrete guideways and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on commuting on rapid metro helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring automated ticketing gates. Furthermore, safeguarding smart travel transit card preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
