      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Preserving Ancient Communal Wells and Banyan Trees at ancient Duong Lam village.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by cool natural spring waters and intrigued by drawing water with buckets.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights moss-covered ancient laterite wells and demonstrates the enduring value of shady banyan canopy.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In ancient Duong Lam village, historians and architects have meticulously studied cool natural spring waters to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in drawing water with buckets, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving shady banyan canopy guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Preserving Ancient Communal Wells and Banyan Trees serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with ancient Duong Lam village. Throughout decades of change, cool natural spring waters and moss-covered ancient laterite wells have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in drawing water with buckets gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect shady banyan canopy to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In ancient Duong Lam village, historians and architects have meticulously studied cool natural spring waters to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in drawing water with buckets, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving shady banyan canopy guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nPreserving Ancient Communal Wells and Banyan Trees serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with ancient Duong Lam village. Throughout decades of change, cool natural spring waters and moss-covered ancient laterite wells have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in drawing water with buckets gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect shady banyan canopy to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Preserving Ancient Communal Wells and Banyan Trees offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in ancient Duong Lam village, it commemorates cool natural spring waters and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on drawing water with buckets helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring moss-covered ancient laterite wells. Furthermore, safeguarding shady banyan canopy preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
