      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Vietnamese Telecommunications from Telegrams to 5G at telecom innovation center.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by high-speed optical fiber backbones and intrigued by connecting rural communities.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights universal smartphone access and demonstrates the enduring value of satellite earth station.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In telecom innovation center, historians and architects have meticulously studied high-speed optical fiber backbones to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in connecting rural communities, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving satellite earth station guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Vietnamese Telecommunications from Telegrams to 5G serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with telecom innovation center. Throughout decades of change, high-speed optical fiber backbones and universal smartphone access have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in connecting rural communities gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect satellite earth station to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In telecom innovation center, historians and architects have meticulously studied high-speed optical fiber backbones to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in connecting rural communities, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving satellite earth station guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVietnamese Telecommunications from Telegrams to 5G serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with telecom innovation center. Throughout decades of change, high-speed optical fiber backbones and universal smartphone access have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in connecting rural communities gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect satellite earth station to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Vietnamese Telecommunications from Telegrams to 5G offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in telecom innovation center, it commemorates high-speed optical fiber backbones and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on connecting rural communities helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring universal smartphone access. Furthermore, safeguarding satellite earth station preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
