      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Healthcare Improvements in Remote Mountainous Communes at rural health clinic.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by telemedicine satellite links and intrigued by providing emergency healthcare.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights modern maternal ultrasound scanners and demonstrates the enduring value of mobile medical doctor.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In rural health clinic, historians and architects have meticulously studied telemedicine satellite links to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in providing emergency healthcare, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving mobile medical doctor guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Healthcare Improvements in Remote Mountainous Communes serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with rural health clinic. Throughout decades of change, telemedicine satellite links and modern maternal ultrasound scanners have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in providing emergency healthcare gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect mobile medical doctor to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In rural health clinic, historians and architects have meticulously studied telemedicine satellite links to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in providing emergency healthcare, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving mobile medical doctor guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHealthcare Improvements in Remote Mountainous Communes serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with rural health clinic. Throughout decades of change, telemedicine satellite links and modern maternal ultrasound scanners have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in providing emergency healthcare gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect mobile medical doctor to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
