      "audioScript": "What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nI am presenting about Reviving Traditional Lacquerware Art in Duyen Thai Village at lacquerware artisan workshop.\nWhat is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nHistorians and travelers are captivated by lustrous layers of natural sap and intrigued by polishing delicate lacquer trays.\nHow does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nIt highlights inlaid shimmering mother-of-pearl and demonstrates the enduring value of master artisan craftsman.\nOutstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In lacquerware artisan workshop, historians and architects have meticulously studied lustrous layers of natural sap to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in polishing delicate lacquer trays, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving master artisan craftsman guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Reviving Traditional Lacquerware Art in Duyen Thai Village serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with lacquerware artisan workshop. Throughout decades of change, lustrous layers of natural sap and inlaid shimmering mother-of-pearl have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in polishing delicate lacquer trays gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect master artisan craftsman to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In lacquerware artisan workshop, historians and architects have meticulously studied lustrous layers of natural sap to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in polishing delicate lacquer trays, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving master artisan craftsman guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nReviving Traditional Lacquerware Art in Duyen Thai Village serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with lacquerware artisan workshop. Throughout decades of change, lustrous layers of natural sap and inlaid shimmering mother-of-pearl have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in polishing delicate lacquer trays gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect master artisan craftsman to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Reviving Traditional Lacquerware Art in Duyen Thai Village offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in lacquerware artisan workshop, it commemorates lustrous layers of natural sap and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on polishing delicate lacquer trays helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring inlaid shimmering mother-of-pearl. Furthermore, safeguarding master artisan craftsman preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
